  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fbstylia\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MineshaftsMonsters/bh_promo.png\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">&nbsp;想和朋友一起玩 MnM 嗎？透過使用 BisectHosting（點擊上方）即可獲得折扣伺服器，同時也能支持本整合包！</span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aKrUt-_nvjQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MineshaftsMonsters/bh_header.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MineshaftsMonsters/bh_1.png\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">完整的強制任務線，以及豐富的支線任務</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">沉浸式的劇情體驗！</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">眾多 QOL（遊戲體驗優化）模組</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">數百種全新建築結構</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">提供關於本整合包關鍵資訊的深度維基頁面 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmineshafts-monsters.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fMineshafts_%2526_Monsters_Wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\">[連結]</span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">數百種動物、怪物與龍</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">不同陣營的生物會互相戰鬥！（跨模組相容性！）</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">各陣營聲望系統</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">令人驚嘆的生物群落與完整的洞穴重製</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">使用區塊載入器，讓您在外出探索時殖民地仍能持續運作！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">LITE 輕量版：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">如果您想嘗試：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 更佳的幀率（FPS）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 更低的記憶體（RAM）佔用</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 更接近原版（Vanilla）的遊戲體驗</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:symbol\">👉🏻<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/mineshafts-monsters-lite\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/mineshafts-monsters-lite</a>👈🏻</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">ADVENTURE 冒險版：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您想嘗試：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 純冒險體驗</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 戰鬥等級升級系統</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 無 MineColonies（王國建設）與聲望系統</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:symbol\">👉🏻<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/mineshafts-monsters-adventure\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/mineshafts-monsters-adventure</a>👈🏻</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MineshaftsMonsters/bh_2.png\"></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">教學影片：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/h4JirI15B7Q?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">實機演示 - 英語：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Mineshafts and Monsters Mowzie 更新版 100 天挑戰 -</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/peLFzIDufKE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Mineshafts &amp; Monsters QOL 更新版 100 天挑戰（多人遊戲！） -</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/T7lXFqlTiBY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">*註：感謝此影片，QOL 更新的許多錯誤與崩潰問題已獲得修復 :D</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">實機演示 - 俄語/русский：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Полное прохождение сборки Mineshafts and Monsters в обновлении Mowzies Mob -</span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RItQevI5_04?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MineshaftsMonsters/bh_3.png\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">1) 安裝 Overwolf CurseForge 啟動器：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcurseforge.overwolf.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://curseforge.overwolf.com/</a> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">2) 為 Minecraft 分配足夠的記憶體，但切勿過多。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">3) 在整合包中搜尋「Mineshafts &amp; Monsters」並安裝。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">4) 若您想要使用光影與額外功能，請安裝 OptiFine 並移除 Magnesium。若追求最佳效能且不需要其他功能，請保持預設設定不動。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><strong>系統需求：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">完整版：最低 6 GB，建議 7-8 GB</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">輕量版：最低 4 GB，建議 6-7 GB</span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MineshaftsMonsters/bh_4.png\"><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">Q: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">為什麼任務書是空的？</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">A: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">任務書會追蹤您的進度，若您尚未進行任何任務便不會顯示內容。若要開始遊玩，請依照目標指示（擊敗掠奪者）並與村民交易。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"><strong>Q:</strong> 為什麼部分模組無法正常運作？</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"><strong>A:</strong> 本整合包對各模組進行了大量客製化調整以符合整體需求。部分機制受到限制或已停用。無論如何，我們建議您直接進入遊戲，憑藉遊戲內指南書籍（或必要時查閱線上模組維基）邊玩邊學。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">Q:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"> 我可以新增或移除整合包內的模組嗎？</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"><br><strong>A: </strong>您可以自行新增或移除模組用於個人遊玩。然而，強烈建議您不要移除整合包內的模組，以免破壞遊戲進度流程。若您偏好高度可自訂的整合包，建議使用舊版「U Die U Noob」發行版本，該版本並未設定進度線。<br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"><strong>Q:</strong> 冒險版與一般版有什麼區別？</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"><strong>A:</strong> 冒險版是「不含」MineColonies 的版本。它採用「RerSkillable」模組，這是 RLCraft 用來將物品鎖定於等級後的機制。一般版則包含標準的 MineColonies 與聲望系統。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">Q:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"> 我可以移除資源包嗎？</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">A:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"> 不建議移除，基於多項原因，它是本整合包不可或缺的組成部分。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">Q:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"> 我需要 OptiFine 嗎？</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">A:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"> 強烈建議安裝。但若引發問題，您也可以移除它，只是部分功能可能會出現錯誤或顯示異常。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">Q:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"> 整合包讓我感到卡頓，我該怎麼辦？</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">A:</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">嘗試 LITE 輕量版！&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/mineshafts-monsters-lite\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/mineshafts-monsters-lite</a></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">延遲尖峰（Lag Spikes）：</span>請確保您未為遊戲分配過少或過多的 RAM，兩者皆會導致效能問題。此外，建議使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/world-pre-generator\" rel=\"nofollow\">World Pregenerator</a> 進行世界預生成！</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">幀率下降（FPS Lag）：</span>很遺憾，由於整合包體積龐大，幀率波動是不可避免的。話雖如此，配備尚可的電腦搭配 OptiFine/Sodium 應能穩定維持 80+ FPS。關於光影，最相容的光影已存放在 shaders 資料夾中，但實際上僅推薦一般電腦使用「Builder's QOL」。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">Q:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"> 為什麼伺服器整合包中沒有 server.jar 檔案？</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\">A:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:150%\"> 您需要先建立一個 Forge 伺服器，然後將伺服器整合包拖曳至伺服器資料夾內。此外，請務必閱讀 README.txt 並依照指示操作！</span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">想要獲取遊戲內指南、錯誤/崩潰支援，或是尋找朋友一同遊玩本整合包嗎？</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fUjPx5jzd3m\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EuHBB1X.png\"></a></p>",
